WEBVTT

00:00:59.339 --> 00:01:02.125
And it's true that those
who continue to smoke

00:01:02.149 --> 00:01:04.783
are smoking far fewer cigarettes per day

00:01:04.807 --> 00:01:06.674
than at any time in history.

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:11.936
But what if I told you
that tobacco use,

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:15.268
primarily because of firsthand
and secondhand exposure

00:01:15.292 --> 00:01:18.006
to the smoke in cigarettes,

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:21.788
remains the leading cause of completely
preventable disease and death

00:01:21.812 --> 00:01:22.962
in this country?

00:01:24.196 --> 00:01:25.396
Well, that's true.

00:01:26.988 --> 00:01:30.948
And what if I told you
that it's actually killing more people